\newlabel{fig:FF_bonded}{{3.3}{52}{Schematic representation of the bonded interactions included in the bonded term of the potential function. \textbf {A} depicts the bond stretching, \textbf {B} angle bending, \textbf {C} the torsion of a proper dihedral and \textbf {D} the bending of an improper dihedral}{figure.caption.8}{}}
