\newlabel{fig:AA2CG}{{3.4}{55}{Representation of the 3D structure of a CP with sequence \underline {L}L\underline {L}L\underline {L}L\underline {L}L using an AA force field (left) and its corresponding mapping into Martini CG (right). Underlined letters refer to \textit {D}-amino acids}{figure.caption.9}{}}
